<title>UK: SanCor Cooperativas sets $50 mln five-yr Eurobond.</title>
<headline>SanCor Cooperativas sets $50 mln five-yr Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Citicorp Capital Markets SA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SANCOR COOPERATIVAS UNIDAS LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     11.0	MATURITY    07.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.5865   PAY DATE    07.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.5865   SPREAD	+490 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    *	   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125 PCT MGT/UND    0.6875    SELL CONC   0.4375</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S TREASURY 6.25 PCT DUE OCT 2001</p>
<p> NOTES	*LUXEMBOURG AND BUENOS AIRES</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
